  "intro": {
    "title": "Haben does double duty",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Haben means 'to have', and German uses it for things English says with 'be': Ich habe Hunger (I'm hungry), Ich habe Zeit (I'm free). It's also the helper verb for most past tenses: Ich habe gegessen."
    ]
  },
